  "goodToKnow": "Herbei means here, towards the speaker, and is mostly a separable prefix: herbeirufen (to summon), herbeieilen (to hurry over), herbeisehnen (to long for), and herbeiführen (to bring about): eine Entscheidung herbeiführen. The Christmas carol Herbei, o ihr Gläub'gen is the German version of O Come, All Ye Faithful. In speech, people say her or hierher."
